<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <title>Daily Japan Signals | Neon Tokyo Signals</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <meta name="description" content="Daily Japan equity signal board after the Tokyo close. Top 20 short-term decision board with actionable signals, blocked high-score names, market tape and risk controls."/>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050711"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/daily_jp.css?v={{ asset_version }}"/>
</head>

<body>
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="ambient ambient-a"></div>
  <div class="ambient ambient-b"></div>
  <div class="ambient ambient-c"></div>
  <div class="grid"></div>
  <div class="scanline"></div>

  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="brand-mark">NTS</span>
        <span>
          <strong>NEON TOKYO SIGNALS</strong>
          <em>Japan equity signals after the Tokyo close.</em>
        </span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/japan/daily/" class="active">Daily</a>
        <a href="/japan/daily/backtest/">Backtest</a>
        <a href="/japan/weekly/">Weekly</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero cockpit">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> DAILY JP DECISION BOARD · TOP {{ main_rank_limit }}</div>
        <h1>
          Decide in five seconds.
          <span>Then inspect the tape.</span>
        </h1>
        <p>
          A short-term signal board for Japanese equities after the Tokyo close.
          The model separates actionable Trade/Watch candidates from high-score names
          blocked by timing, liquidity or risk controls. News is intentionally excluded.
        </p>

        <div class="verdict-card verdict-{{ setup_quality.verdict_tone }}">
          <div>
            <span>Today’s model verdict</span>
            <strong>{{ setup_quality.verdict }}</strong>
          </div>
          <p>{{ setup_quality.verdict_text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-panels">
        <article class="hero-panel action-panel">
          <div class="panel-label">ACTIONABLE SIGNAL</div>
          {% if actionable_signal %}
            <div class="ticker-row">
              <strong>{{ actionable_signal.symbol }}</strong>
              <span class="tag triage-{{ (actionable_signal.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ actionable_signal.triage }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-name">{{ actionable_signal.name }}</div>
            <div class="panel-score">{{ actionable_signal.score_display }} <span>pts</span></div>
            <div class="decision-line">{{ actionable_signal.decision_label }}</div>
            <p>{{ actionable_signal.decision_reason }}</p>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ticker-row no-action"><strong>NO TRADE</strong><span class="tag triage-ignore">Capital first</span></div>
            <div class="panel-name">No Trade/Watch candidate cleared the daily decision rules.</div>
            <div class="panel-score muted">0 <span>actionable</span></div>
            <p>Use the blocked list as a watchlist, not as a trade list.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>

        <article class="hero-panel score-panel">
          <div class="panel-label">HIGHEST SCORE</div>
          {% if highest_score_item %}
            <div class="ticker-row">
              <strong>{{ highest_score_item.symbol }}</strong>
              <span class="tag triage-{{ (highest_score_item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ highest_score_item.triage }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-name">{{ highest_score_item.name }}</div>
            <div class="panel-score">{{ highest_score_item.score_display }} <span>pts</span></div>
            <div class="decision-line">{{ highest_score_item.decision_label }}</div>
            <p>{{ highest_score_item.decision_reason }}</p>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ticker-row no-action"><strong>NO DATA</strong></div>
            <p>Daily signal JSON has not been generated yet.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="meta-strip">
      <div><span>Generated</span><strong>{{ generated_at or "—" }}</strong></div>
      <div><span>Price Data</span><strong>{{ source_prices_generated_at or "—" }}</strong></div>
      <div><span>Regime</span><strong>{{ payload.regime or "—" }}</strong></div>
      <div><span>Universe</span><strong>{{ summary.items_count or all_items|length }} names</strong></div>
    </section>

    <section class="decision-summary" aria-label="5-second daily decision summary">
      <article class="summary-tile trade">
        <span>Trade</span>
        <strong>{{ setup_quality.trade_count }}</strong>
        <em>Full threshold</em>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-tile watch">
        <span>Watch</span>
        <strong>{{ setup_quality.watch_count }}</strong>
        <em>Actionable monitor</em>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-tile blocked">
        <span>Blocked High Score</span>
        <strong>{{ setup_quality.blocked_high_count }}</strong>
        <em>Score ≥ {{ blocked_score_floor }}</em>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-tile danger">
        <span>Risk Warnings</span>
        <strong>{{ setup_quality.risk_count }}</strong>
        <em>Top {{ main_rank_limit }}</em>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-tile favored">
        <span>Favored Setups</span>
        <strong>{{ setup_quality.favored_count }}</strong>
        <em>RS / Compression</em>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="visual-board">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">5-SECOND READ</div>
          <h2>Actionability before detail.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">Primary Daily lens: 1D / 3D / 5D / 10D · 20D reference only</div>
      </div>

      <div class="visual-grid">
        <article class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-title">Triage mix</div>
          <div class="stacked-bar" aria-label="Triage distribution">
            {% for bar in bar_data.triage_bars %}
              <span class="seg seg-{{ bar.label|lower }}" style="width:{{ bar.width }}%"></span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="bar-legend">
            {% for bar in bar_data.triage_bars %}
              <span><i class="dot dot-{{ bar.label|lower }}"></i>{{ bar.label }} {{ bar.count }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-title">Score distribution</div>
          <div class="score-bars">
            {% for bar in bar_data.score_bars %}
              <div>
                <span>{{ bar.label }}</span>
                <i style="width:{{ bar.width }}%"></i>
                <strong>{{ bar.count }}</strong>
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-title">Board role</div>
          <div class="role-meter">
            <div><strong>{{ main_items|length }}</strong><span>Main Top {{ main_rank_limit }}</span></div>
            <div><strong>{{ reference_items|length }}</strong><span>Reference 21–{{ reference_limit }}</span></div>
          </div>
          <p>Rank 21–50 is intentionally not treated as the main Daily decision set.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="market-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">MARKET CONTEXT</div>
          <h2>Broad trend versus short-term tape.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">Avoid reading Risk-On when the short-term tape is weak</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pulse-grid">
        {% for pulse in market_pulse %}
          <article class="pulse-card">
            <div class="pulse-top">
              <div>
                <div class="pulse-label">{{ pulse.label }}</div>
                <div class="pulse-regime">{{ pulse.broad_trend }}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="pulse-score">{{ pulse.pulse_score_0_100 | fmt_score }}<span>pulse</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tape-badge">{{ pulse.short_tape }}</div>
            <div class="pulse-metrics">
              <div><span>1D</span><strong class="{{ pulse.return_1d_class }}">{{ pulse.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>5D Tape</span><strong class="{{ pulse.return_5d_class }}">{{ pulse.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>20D Trend</span><strong class="{{ pulse.return_20d_class }}">{{ pulse.return_20d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% else %}
          <article class="empty-card">Market pulse data is not available yet.</article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="actionable-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">ACTIONABLE BOARD</div>
          <h2>Trade and Watch candidates only.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">Ignore is not a mistake; it means the trigger did not clear</div>
      </div>

      <div class="cards action-cards">
        {% for item in actionable_items %}
          <article class="signal-card action-card {{ item.score_class }} triage-card-{{ (item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }} {% if item.has_good_flags %}has-good{% endif %} {% if item.has_risk_flags %}has-risk{% endif %}">
            <div class="card-top">
              <div class="rank">#{{ item.rank }}</div>
              <div class="score">{{ item.score_display }}<span>pts</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="signal-tags">
              <span class="tag triage-{{ (item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ item.triage }}</span>
              <span class="tag">{{ item.archetype or "Mixed" }}</span>
              <span class="tag {{ item.liquidity_class }}">{{ item.liquidity_band }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="symbol-row"><h3>{{ item.symbol }}</h3><span class="bucket">{{ item.bucket }}</span></div>
            <div class="name">{{ item.name }}</div>
            <div class="theme">{{ item.theme }}</div>
            <div class="decision-box"><strong>{{ item.decision_label }}</strong><span>{{ item.decision_reason }}</span></div>
            <div class="metric-grid">
              <div><span>1D</span><strong class="{{ item.return_1d_class }}">{{ item.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>5D</span><strong class="{{ item.return_5d_class }}">{{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>10D</span><strong class="{{ item.return_10d_class }}">{{ item.return_10d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>RVOL</span><strong>{{ item.volume_ratio_20d | fmt_score }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>Avg Value</span><strong>{{ item.avg_traded_value_20d_jpy | fmt_jpy }}</strong></div>
              <div><span>Risk</span><strong class="{{ item.risk_class }}">{{ item.risk_level }}</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div class="component-bars">
              <div><span>Volume</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.volume }}%"></i></div>
              <div><span>Compression</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.compression }}%"></i></div>
              <div><span>Breakout</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.breakout }}%"></i></div>
              <div><span>RS</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.relative_strength }}%"></i></div>
              <div><span>Entry</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.entry }}%"></i></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flags">
              {% for flag in item.good_flags[:4] %}<span class="good">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}
              {% for flag in item.risk_flags[:4] %}<span class="danger">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}
            </div>
          </article>
        {% else %}
          <article class="empty-card action-empty">
            <strong>No actionable Trade/Watch today.</strong>
            <span>The model did not find a short-term setup strong enough to act on. Review blocked high-score names only as a watchlist.</span>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blocked-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">BLOCKED HIGH SCORE</div>
          <h2>Strong names that still failed the action trigger.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">This is the highest-value watchlist for tomorrow</div>
      </div>

      <div class="cards compact-cards">
        {% for item in blocked_high_score_items %}
          <article class="signal-card blocked-card {{ item.score_class }} {% if item.has_good_flags %}has-good{% endif %} {% if item.has_risk_flags %}has-risk{% endif %}">
            <div class="card-top">
              <div class="rank">#{{ item.rank }}</div>
              <div class="score">{{ item.score_display }}<span>pts</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="symbol-row"><h3>{{ item.symbol }}</h3><span class="tag triage-ignore">Blocked</span></div>
            <div class="name">{{ item.name }}</div>
            <div class="decision-box"><strong>{{ item.decision_label }}</strong><span>{{ item.decision_reason }}</span></div>
            <div class="mini-metrics">
              <span class="{{ item.return_1d_class }}">1D {{ item.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</span>
              <span class="{{ item.return_5d_class }}">5D {{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</span>
              <span>{{ item.liquidity_band }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flags">
              {% for flag in item.good_flags[:3] %}<span class="good">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}
              {% for flag in item.risk_flags[:3] %}<span class="danger">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}
            </div>
          </article>
        {% else %}
          <article class="empty-card">No high-score blocked names today.</article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="main-board-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">MAIN DAILY BOARD</div>
          <h2>Top {{ main_rank_limit }} ranked candidates.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">Decision-first table · not a buy list</div>
      </div>

      <div class="table-wrap decision-table">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Rank</th>
              <th>Decision</th>
              <th>Symbol</th>
              <th>Name</th>
              <th>Score</th>
              <th>Archetype</th>
              <th>Setup / Blocker</th>
              <th>1D</th>
              <th>5D</th>
              <th>RVOL</th>
              <th>Liquidity</th>
              <th>Risk</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for item in main_items %}
              <tr class="{% if item.triage in ['Trade','Watch'] %}row-action{% elif item.has_risk_flags %}row-risk{% elif item.has_good_flags %}row-good{% endif %}">
                <td>#{{ item.rank }}</td>
                <td><span class="mini-tag triage-{{ (item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ item.triage }}</span></td>
                <td><strong>{{ item.symbol }}</strong></td>
                <td>{{ item.name }}</td>
                <td>
                  <div class="score-cell"><strong>{{ item.score_display }}</strong><i style="width:{{ item.score_width }}%"></i></div>
                </td>
                <td>{{ item.archetype or "Mixed" }}</td>
                <td class="decision-cell">{{ item.decision_label }}</td>
                <td class="{{ item.return_1d_class }}">{{ item.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</td>
                <td class="{{ item.return_5d_class }}">{{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</td>
                <td>{{ item.volume_ratio_20d | fmt_score }}</td>
                <td><span class="liq-pill {{ item.liquidity_class }}">{{ item.liquidity_band }}</span></td>
                <td class="{{ item.risk_class }}">{{ item.risk_level }}</td>
              </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="insight-lanes-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">SETUP INTELLIGENCE</div>
          <h2>What to lean into, what to avoid.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">Labels are translated from internal model flags</div>
      </div>

      <div class="insight-lanes">
        <article class="lane-card favored">
          <div class="lane-head"><span>FAVORED SETUPS</span><strong>{{ favored_items|length }}</strong></div>
          <div class="mini-list">
            {% for item in favored_items %}
              <div class="mini-row good">
                <strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }}</strong>
                <span>{{ item.good_flags[0] }}</span>
                <em>{{ item.score_display }} pts</em>
              </div>
            {% else %}
              <div class="mini-empty">No favored setup flags in the main board.</div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="lane-card warning">
          <div class="lane-head"><span>RISK WARNINGS</span><strong>{{ risk_items|length }}</strong></div>
          <div class="mini-list">
            {% for item in risk_items %}
              <div class="mini-row danger">
                <strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }}</strong>
                <span>{{ item.risk_flags[0] }}</span>
                <em>{{ item.triage }}</em>
              </div>
            {% else %}
              <div class="mini-empty">No risk-control flags in the main board.</div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reference-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">REFERENCE ONLY</div>
          <h2>Rank 21–{{ reference_limit }} is not the core Daily board.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="method-chip">Backtest showed Rank 21–50 quality drops materially</div>
      </div>

      <div class="reference-grid">
        {% for item in reference_items[:18] %}
          <div class="reference-pill {% if item.has_risk_flags %}risk{% elif item.has_good_flags %}good{% endif %}">
            <strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }} · {{ item.score_display }} pts</strong>
            <span>{{ item.triage }} · {{ item.archetype or 'Mixed' }} · 5D {{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</span>
          </div>
        {% else %}
          <article class="empty-card">No reference items available.</article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="method-section">
      <div class="method-card">
        <div class="kicker">METHODOLOGY</div>
        <h2>Daily Event Score v2</h2>
        <p>
          This page is a short-term decision board, not a generic momentum ranking.
          The model rewards volume/liquidity shock, compression release, breakout setup,
          relative strength versus TOPIX and entry timing. It also blocks risky tape patterns
          such as noisy volume, distribution and volume-breakout exhaustion.
        </p>
        <div class="method-grid">
          <div><span>Volume / Liquidity</span><strong>24%</strong></div>
          <div><span>Compression Release</span><strong>22%</strong></div>
          <div><span>Breakout Setup</span><strong>20%</strong></div>
          <div><span>Relative Strength</span><strong>16%</strong></div>
          <div><span>Entry Timing</span><strong>15%</strong></div>
          <div><span>Market Regime</span><strong>3%</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="method-card warning">
        <div class="kicker">HOW TO READ</div>
        <h2>Ignore can be a useful result.</h2>
        <p>
          A high-score Ignore is not necessarily bad. It often means the stock has strength,
          but the model is waiting for a cleaner trigger. Trade and Watch are the only
          actionable lanes. Blocked names are watchlist material, not buy signals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="notes">
      <strong>Not investment advice.</strong>
      <span>
        Daily v2 excludes news, disclosures and fundamentals. It is a price/volume/timing
        signal layer only. Small-cap and low-liquidity stocks can move violently.
      </span>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      <span>Informational only. Not investment advice.</span>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/japan/daily/backtest/">Backtest</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </main>
</div>

{# Inline macro-like card markup kept here to avoid introducing another template file. #}
<template id="unused"></template>
</body>
</html>
